60,95,24]],"links":[["Pottawattamie County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/iowa/pottawattamie-county"],["ARC or PLC in Pottawattamie County","/arc-plc/iowa/pottawattamie-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 30% of normal in January to February and 150% in June to July. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 47% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 25340 had its driest year in 1988 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
